25:["$","p",null,{"style":{"color":"var(--text-secondary)","marginBottom":"1.5rem","lineHeight":1.7},"children":"The system follows a modular pipeline architecture. The Ingestion Layer ingests resumes via FastAPI multipart endpoints and extracts raw text via PyMuPDF. The NLP Engine cleans the text, tokenizes, removes stopwords, and performs custom spaCy NER to extract hard technical skills and qualifications. The Vector Matcher converts candidate text and job descriptions into high-dimensional vectors, calculating cosine similarity. Results are persisted to SQLite/PostgreSQL with candidate rank scores."}]
2f:T95a,+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                        CLIENT / RECRUITER UI                            |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
                                     | (PDF/DOCX Upload + Job Spec)
                                     v
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                         FASTAPI INGESTION API                           |
|               (Async Multipart Validation & Queueing)                   |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
                                     |
                                     v
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                        DOCUMENT EXTRACTION LAYER                        |
|           (PyMuPDF / pdfplumber Text & Structure Normalizer)            |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
                                     |
                                     v
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                          NLP PROCESSING PIPELINE                        |
|   - spaCy Named Entity Recognition (Skill & Education Extraction)       |
|   - Tokenization & Lemmatization                                        |
|   - Sentence-Transformers / TF-IDF Vectorizer                           |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
                                     |
                                     v
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                         MATCHING & SCORING ENGINE                       |
|   - Cosine Similarity Computation (Candidate Vector vs Job Vector)      |
|   - Skill Gap Penalty Matrix Calculation                                |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
                                     |
                                     v
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                       PERSISTENCE & RANKING STORE                       |
|          (SQLite / PostgreSQL: Candidates, JobSpecs, MatchLogs)         |
